tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-03T17:50:03Z"},"body":"Addresses [one of the complains about the new style](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111118#issuecomment-3463630628). One which I couldn't disagree.\r\n\r\nThe new style makes the Input Map editor too flat. I modified it so it at least highlights the actions.\r\n\r\nThis is done by using `TreeItem::CELL_MODE_CUSTOM` alongside a callback that draws a StyleBox, which I named `style_highlight_subsection`. The Deadzone column uses `TreeItem::CELL_MODE_RANGE`, meaning it can't be applied to them, unfortunately.\r\n\r\nI avoided picking a color too bright as it would make the contrast between the text and the background too low, so it's just a tiny increase to work as a separator.\r\n\r\nThe StyleBox is fully transparent in the Classic theme, therefore it should not be affected.\r\n\r\n### Dark theme\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| ![before_dark](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66afb4f0-2c83-45ad-bd6b-27268508c261) | ![after_dark](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7e2c7c2-e6a9-4f0a-b733-3ee4f609fcc5) |\r\n\r\n\r\n### Light theme\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| ![before_light](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db7bf0e5-b549-44d1-94c9-47adec420ebe) | ![after_light](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f060c06-e8c0-4450-b5ca-bef52620006f) |\r\n\r\nClassic style for reference:\r\n![old](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5091dccd-d41a-42fb-b38c-3a065e26220f)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233/reactions","total_count":34,"+1":23,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":6,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}